<view class="web-topbar"><view class="web-breadcrumb">你的模拟空间<text>/</text><text class="current">放下练习</text></view><view class="web-header-actions"><button class="web-account account-pill" bindtap="goAccount">{{accountLabel}}</button><button class="web-sound" bindtap="toggleSound" aria-label="切换音效"><image class="web-icon" src="/assets/ui/{{sound ? 'sound' : 'mute'}}-green.png"/></button></view></view>
<view class="web-content {{reduced ? 'reduced' : ''}}">
  <view class="web-heading"><view class="web-eyebrow">TAKE A BREATH. MAKE A LITTLE SPACE.</view><view class="web-title">先放下，再呼吸。</view><view class="web-subtitle">冲动出现时，给自己一点缓冲。此刻不必急着做决定。</view></view>
  <view class="web-card web-breathing-card"><text class="web-subtle">一分钟 · 自然呼吸</text><view class="web-breath-orbit"><view class="web-breath-circle {{running ? 'running' : ''}}"><image src="/assets/ui/leaf-green.png"/><view>{{phase}}</view><text>{{running ? '还剩 ' + seconds + ' 秒' : completed ? '给下一次选择留一点空间' : '按舒适的节奏呼吸'}}</text></view></view><view class="web-breath-title">给身体一个小小的休息。</view><view class="web-breath-description">跟随圆圈轻轻吸气、缓缓呼气。不需要屏息；</view><view class="web-breath-description">若感到不适，随时停止，恢复自然呼吸。</view><button wx:if="{{!running}}" class="web-primary" bindtap="start">{{completed ? '再练习一分钟' : '放下模拟，开始 1 分钟'}}</button><button wx:else class="web-stop" bindtap="stop">提前结束</button><view wx:if="{{running}}" class="web-breath-note">完整练习 60 秒才记录一次；离开页面或切后台会结束本次。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view>
  <view class="web-card web-quit-card"><view class="web-tip-number">01 / 延迟</view><view class="web-breath-title">先等五分钟。</view><view class="web-description">冲动会来，也会慢慢过去。喝点水，走动一下，把注意力转向身边正在发生的事。</view></view>
  <view class="web-card web-quit-card"><view class="web-tip-number">02 / 替代</view><view class="web-breath-title">给习惯一个新出口。</view><view class="web-description">散步、伸展、喝水，或做一次简单的呼吸练习。结合自身口腔情况，考虑用无糖口香糖替代咀嚼动作。</view></view>
  <view class="web-card web-quit-card"><view class="web-tip-number">03 / 支持</view><view class="web-breath-title">不用一个人硬扛。</view><view class="web-description">告诉亲友你的戒除计划。戒烟困难可咨询戒烟门诊；口腔溃疡超过两周不愈、张口受限等，应及时到口腔科检查。</view></view>
  <view class="web-health"><view class="web-health-icon"><image src="/assets/ui/heart-gold.png"/></view><view class="web-health-copy"><view class="web-health-title">每一次放下，都可以是开始。</view><view>本练习仅用于放松，不替代专业医疗或戒断治疗。</view></view></view>
</view>
